VayuSetu AI pitch deck outline
Title: VayuSetu AI — See pollution earlier. Act closer to the community.
Problem: city monitoring can miss hyper-local pollution.
Users: residents, schools, hospitals, municipal teams, and pollution authorities.
Solution: citizen reports + official AQI + weather + sensor/satellite context.
Workflow: report → Gemini analysis → correlation → forecast → alert → action.
AI approach: Gemini Vision, multilingual extraction, explanation, and deterministic risk scoring.
Data and trust: CPCB, IMD, citizen reports, timestamps, uncertainty, and labelled demo data.
Product demo: Overview, Report, Forecast, Authority, and City Network.
Impact: earlier warnings and targeted inspections.
Scalability: city nodes share anonymised signals while raw data stays local.
Deployment plan: pilot one corridor, validate, then add cities and languages.
Closing: VayuSetu converts community evidence into coordinated climate action.
